1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:11,290
Every project starts with an agreement. But when work, milestones, and money come together, trust alone isn't always enough.

2
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:31,030
Meet FairHold. A milestone based platform designed to bring structure, evidence, and accountability to payments.

3
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:50,030
FairHold brings buyers and sellers into a structured deal workflow, where expectations and milestones are clearly defined.

4
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:10,430
Instead of treating an entire project as one uncertain transaction, FairHold organizes the work into individual milestones.

5
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:28,650
Work can be supported with evidence, giving reviewers something concrete to evaluate before a decision.

6
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:48,880
Submitted evidence enters a review process. The decision remains with the authorized human reviewer. AI can assist, but it does not replace human judgment.

7
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:12,920
The guided demo illustrates the capture stage using a simulated payment flow, without moving real money.

8
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:28,570
That's the principle behind FairHold. AI provides assistance. Humans make the decisions. Deterministic rules govern payment operations.

9
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:48,950
FairHold. Bringing structure and accountability to milestone based payments.

